        <item>
            <title>0.19.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:04:19 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1902</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Meetings, by week.</b> The Meetings screen now opens on this week,
      the same size as Focus. Pick a day to see its meetings, and use the
      magnifier (⌘F) to search titles, people and everything that was said.</li>
  <li><b>A calmer meeting page.</b> Each meeting now has two tabs, Notes and
      Transcript. Notes shows the summary and the action points, which you
      can tick off as you go. While a meeting records, the timer sits next
      to Finish and the transcript fills in live.</li>
  <li><b>Copy a meeting.</b> The ⋯ menu copies the notes or the whole
      transcript, ready to paste anywhere.</li>
  <li><b>One clear link when a source disconnects.</b> Focus now offers a
      single "Reconnect in Settings…" link.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
